Bible App credits
=================

Commentary
----------
Matthew Henry's Concise Commentary. Text: Christian Classics Ethereal Library via CrossWire Bible Society. Public domain.

Source: CrossWire Bible Society SWORD module MHCC, version 2.0 (2021-02-14),
https://www.crosswire.org/sword/modules/ModInfo.jsp?modName=MHCC
Distribution License: "Public Domain". The module's text source is CCEL
(https://ccel.org/ccel/h/henry/mhcc/cache/mhcc.txt).
The build scripts that turn the module into assets/study.db are in tools/study-db/.

Bible text
----------
All Bible translations included are in the public domain.
The Berean Standard Bible (BSB) text comes from the publisher's official download at
https://bereanbible.com/bsb.txt (3rd printing, fetched 2026-11-04). The Holy Bible,
Berean Standard Bible, BSB is produced in cooperation with Bible Hub, Discovery Bible,
OpenBible.com, and the Berean Bible Translation Committee. This text of God's Word has
been dedicated to the public domain (https://berean.bible/terms.htm).
The other translations (KJV, ASV, WEB, Webster, YLT, Darby) come from eBible.org
(https://ebible.org). Scripts that build and audit the Bible database are in tools/bible-db/.

Concordance
-----------
The concordance is built from the bundled Bible translations.

App icon
--------
The app icon is original artwork made for this app.
